  "body": "Tucked away in a quiet, friendly cul-de-sac surrounded by welcoming neighbours, this stylish standalone home offers the perfect combination of modern design, quality construction and effortless family living.\r\n\r\nWith approximately 172sqm of generous interior space, the thoughtfully designed layout provides excellent flexibility for families of all ages. Both upstairs and downstairs feature their own living area and bedroom suite, creating an ideal setup for extended family, guests or teenagers seeking their own space.\r\n\r\nLocated within the highly sought-after Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College school zones, with schools within easy walking distance, this is a location families will truly appreciate.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n•Two separate living areas - one upstairs and one downstairs\r\n•Ensuite bedroom suites on both levels, ideal for extended family or guests\r\n•Generously sized bedrooms throughout\r\n•Stylish, contemporary design with quality construction\r\n•Central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n•Modern shared bathroom featuring a stylish bathtub\r\n•Internal-access single garage with laundry included for living convenience \r\n•Additional off-street parking\r\n•Friendly and welcoming neighbourhood\r\n•Walking distance to schools with Macleans Primary School only 150 metres\r\n•Zoned for the prestigious Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College\r\n\r\nConvenient Lifestyle Location\r\nEverything you need is within easy reach, including Pak'nSave, Woolworths, Half Moon Bay Marina and Highland Park Shopping Centre.\r\nFor cafes, boutiques, dining and a relaxed village atmosphere, Howick Village is just a few minutes' drive away.\r\n\r\nA Rare Opportunity Not to Be Missed\r\nCombining space, style, quality and an exceptional school-zone location, this is a home that offers genuine versatility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe owner is keen to sell and has priced the property for a quick sale. Opportunities like this are not to be missed!\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing - your next dream home could be waiting for you.",
